invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: a key file's run ends at a refusal as it ends at the text's end,
  so a BEGIN line of another label after the key is skipped. A key file
  that carries a certificate block after its key reads as the key. The
  ruling refuses a BEGIN line of any label but the one the run reads
  (docs/decisions.md 170). test_key_grammar writes the r2 chain after a
  SEC 1 key and requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
    return pem_blocks_next(&blocks, first, first_der, &block, &block_len) == PEM_BLOCKS_END;
--- new
    return pem_blocks_next(&blocks, first, first_der, &block, &block_len) != PEM_BLOCKS_READ;
